OL,3,GNEWSACuban posters on show after       
OL,4,Ablackouts cause delays                 
OL,6,FFilm posters hand-printed in Havana    
OL,7,Fthrough months of blackouts have gone  
OL,8,Fon show in London.                     
OL,10,FThe 11 silkscreen prints were made by  
OL,11,Fthe poster workshop of ICAIC, Cuba's   
OL,12,Fnational film institute, for the recent
OL,13,FLondon Latino Film Festival, which ran 
OL,14,Fin October.                            
OL,16,FThe team had planned 25 designs, but   
OL,17,Fpower cuts, water shortages and a lack 
OL,18,Fof materials meant the work dragged on 
OL,19,Ffor months and only 11 were finished.  
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
