OL,3,GNEWSACuban posters on show after       
OL,4,Ablackouts cause delays                 
OL,6,F"We can't do anything without power,"  
OL,7,Fsaid master printer Markito Guerra     
OL,8,FRojas. "Number one, we can't see.      
OL,9,FNumber two, the materials start to go  
OL,10,Fwrong."                                
